    "body": "**TypeScript Version:**  master\n\n**Code**\n\n``` ts\n(''.match(/ /) || []).map(s => s.toLowerCase());\n```\n\n**Expected behavior:**\n\n```\n$ node built/local/tsc.js --lib es6 --strictNullChecks index.ts\n```\n\n**Actual behavior:** \n\n```\n$ node built/local/tsc.js --lib es6 --strictNullChecks index.ts\nindex.ts(1,1): error TS2349: Cannot invoke an expression whose type lacks a call signature.\n```\n",
